Error [E0957]: `embed_file` path must be a string literal
  --> tests/ui/comptime_embed_nonliteral.jet:1:7
    |
  1 | $d :: embed_file("a" + "b")
    |       ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: a computed path can't be audited at build time, so the compiler can't tell which file it reads
 Fix: pass the path inline, e.g. `embed_file("data/file")`

Error [E0107]: nothing named `$d` exists here
  --> tests/ui/comptime_embed_nonliteral.jet:4:13
    |
  4 |     print("{$d}")
    |             ^^
 Why: a name must be declared before it's used
 Fix: declare it first: `$d :: ...`
